FreeSense static repository client.

Materializes the FreeSense pkg repo channels (devel, release) from a small
public manifest into the per-branch repo confs used by the GUI branch selector
and the repo-setup script. Replaces Netgate's proprietary, entitlement-based
FreeSense-repoc; FreeSense channels are public and fingerprint-signed, so no
authentication or phone-home is required.
